      "title": "Radhe Dhokla Private Limited, Pandav Dishant Kanubhai, Nikunj Vijaybhai Prajapati, Pandav Jinesh Kanaiyalal and Pandav Pradipkumar Vijaybhai entered into a Share Purchase Agreement to acquire 74.40% stake in Shantai Industries Limited (BSE:512297) from Disha Murli Sawlani, Harish Fatandas Sawlani, Murli Fatandas Sawlani, Reena Harish Sawlani and Vasudev Fatandas Sawlani for INR 64.17 million.",
      "body": "Radhe Dhokla Private Limited, Pandav Dishant Kanubhai, Nikunj Vijaybhai Prajapati, Pandav Jinesh Kanaiyalal and Pandav Pradipkumar Vijaybhai entered into a Share Purchase Agreement to acquire 74.40% stake in Shantai Industries Limited (BSE:512297) from Disha Murli Sawlani, Harish Fatandas Sawlani, Murli Fatandas Sawlani, Reena Harish Sawlani and Vasudev Fatandas Sawlani for INR 64.17 million on February 13, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 64.17 million valued at INR 11.5 per share will be paid by the buyers. Radhe Dhokla Private Limited will acquire 66.4% Shantai Industries Limited. In a related transaction Radhe Dhokla Private Limited, Pandav Dishant Kanubhai, Nikunj Vijaybhai Prajapati, Pandav Jinesh Kanaiyalal and Pandav Pradipkumar Vijaybhai offered to acquire 25.60% in Shantai Indus",
